    </string>

    <string id="ui_mcm_hover_corpse_loot_hcl_loot_swap_scroll_axis">
        <text>Invert Default Scroll Axis (Horizontal First)</text>
    </string>
    <string id="ui_mcm_hover_corpse_loot_hcl_loot_swap_scroll_axis_desc">
        <text>OFF (Default): Normal Mouse Wheel scrolls Vertically (Row-to-Row), and holding the Modifier Key scrolls Horizontally (Column-to-Column).\nON (Inverted): Normal Mouse Wheel scrolls Horizontally across items, and holding the Modifier Key jumps Vertically between Rows.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="ui_mcm_hover_corpse_loot_hcl_loot_reset_col_on_row">
        <text>Reset to First Column When Scrolling Rows Up/Down</text>
    </string>
    <string id="ui_mcm_hover_corpse_loot_hcl_loot_reset_col_on_row_desc">
        <text>When enabled, moving Up or Down to a new row always selects the first item (Column 1) of that row. When disabled, it preserves your current column position.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="ui_mcm_hover_corpse_loot_hcl_loot_row_sweep_cooldown">
        <text>Row-Sweep End Safety Brake (Milliseconds)</text>
    </string>
    <string id="ui_mcm_hover_corpse_loot_hcl_loot_sweep_vel_mult">
        <text>Sweep-Loot Dynamic Scroll Velocity Multiplier</text>
    </string>
    <string id="ui_mcm_hover_corpse_loot_hcl_loot_sweep_vel_mult_desc">
        <text>Controls how fast Sweep-Looting (Hold Left Click + Scroll) accelerates when you rapidly spin the scroll wheel on corpses with many items. Normal/deliberate scroll ticks always remain 1:1 (1 item per notch) and strictly stop at the row-end safety brake.\n- 0.0: Disabled (Strict 1:1 on all scroll speeds)\n- 0.5: Default Balanced Acceleration\n- 1.0 - 2.0: High-Speed Sweep Acceleration</text>
    </string>
    <string id="ui_mcm_hover_corpse_loot_hcl_loot_sweep_disassemble">
        <text>Enable Hold Right-Click + Scroll Sweep Disassemble</text>
    </string>
    <string id="ui_mcm_hover_corpse_loot_hcl_loot_sweep_disassemble_desc">
        <text>When enabled, holding Right Mouse Click and scrolling the mouse wheel disassembles items across the current row in a sweeping motion (with the same safety guards and row-end brake as Sweep Looting). Default: OFF.</text>
    </string>

    <!-- Field Strip, Disassemble & Unified Modifier Key Strings -->
    <string id="ui_mcm_hover_corpse_loot_hcl_loot_strip_min_cond">
        <text>Field Strip Minimum Part Condition (%)</text>
    </string>
    <string id="ui_mcm_hover_corpse_loot_hcl_loot_strip_min_cond_desc">
        <text>When Field Stripping a weapon in the Hover UI (Modifier + Left Click), only removable parts (excluding barrels) at or above this condition percentage will be stripped into your inventory. Default: 60%.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="ui_mcm_hover_corpse_loot_hcl_loot_strip_attachments">
        <text>Strip Attached Scopes &amp; Silencers on Field Strip</text>
    </string>
    <string id="ui_mcm_hover_corpse_loot_hcl_loot_strip_attachments_desc">
        <text>When enabled, Field Stripping a weapon (Modifier + Left Click) also detaches any attached Scope and Silencer/Suppressor and transfers them directly into your inventory. Default: ON.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="ui_mcm_hover_corpse_loot_hcl_loot_key_modifier">
        <text>Unified Action &amp; Axis Modifier Key</text>
    </string>
    <string id="ui_mcm_hover_corpse_loot_hcl_loot_key_modifier_desc">
        <text>Hold this single modifier key (Default: Left Alt) while an item is selected to perform modified actions:\n- Modifier + Scroll Wheel: Switch Scroll Axis (Rows / Columns)\n- Modifier + Left Click: Field Strip Selected Weapon\n- Modifier + Right Click: Disassemble Selected Item</text>
    </string>

    <string id="st_hcl_pda_strip_title">
        <text>Field Stripped Weapon</text>
    </string>
    <string id="st_hcl_pda_strip_none">
        <text>No removable parts above threshold</text>
    </string>
